1
00:00:00,594 --> 00:00:05,578
PDF Diva works…
just like a regular PDF reader.

2
00:00:05,974 --> 00:00:08,794
Open your PDFs, preview them…

3
00:00:09,207 --> 00:00:12,396
…and choose the theme you prefer.

4
00:00:12,852 --> 00:00:16,139
But the magic starts when you hit Present.

5
00:00:16,163 --> 00:00:19,107
With two or more screens,
you get the presenter view:

6
00:00:19,131 --> 00:00:24,701
your current slide, what's coming next,
the page number and a timer.

7
00:00:24,809 --> 00:00:27,804
Wrong screen? Don't worry,
you choose what goes on each monitor.

8
00:00:28,132 --> 00:00:32,166
Control it with your mouse…
or with ANY presenter remote.

9
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:36,617

